    "F7: the export wrote every ticket to the fixed shared file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv and then read it back with readfile (lib.php:125-150), so concurrent exports can truncate or overwrite each other between write and read, and the full CSV stays on disk under /var/www/painel/tmp. Real and outside the matrix; it is not BUG-004 (see that row). Fixed by streaming to php://output; no longer writing the on-disk file is neither COMP nor PEN (ruling B, as K).",
